HTML — Taariikh, Ujeeddo iyo Xog Muhiim ah
1. Waa maxay HTML?
HTML (HyperText Markup Language) waa luuqadda calaamadeynta ee lagu dhiso qaab-dhismeedka bogagga webka. HTML ma aha luuqad programming ah; waxay browser-ka u sheegtaa qaybaha bogga sida cinwaannada, qoraallada, sawirrada, links-ka iyo forms-ka.
2. Taariikhda HTML
- 1989–1990: Tim Berners-Lee wuxuu CERN ka bilaabay fikradda World Wide Web, wuxuuna sameeyay aasaaska HTML.
- 1991: Waxaa la faafiyay sharaxaad hore oo ku saabsan HTML tags.
- 1995: HTML 2.0 waxaa loo daabacay heer farsamo (RFC 1866).
- 1997: HTML 3.2 iyo HTML 4.0 ayaa la soo saaray.
- 1999: HTML 4.01 ayaa la daabacay.
- 2014: HTML5 wuxuu noqday W3C Recommendation.
- Maanta: HTML waxaa loo horumariyaa sidii HTML Living Standard oo WHATWG maamusho; ma aha hal nooc oo mar keliya dhammaada.
3. Maxaa HTML loo isticmaalaa?
1. In lagu sameeyo qaab-dhismeedka website.
2. In lagu qoro headings, paragraphs iyo lists.
3. In lagu daro sawirro, cod iyo muuqaal.
4. In lagu sameeyo links iyo navigation.
5. In lagu dhiso forms xog lagu geliyo.
6. In la isticmaalo semantic elements si boggu u noqdo mid la fahmi karo oo accessibility fiican leh.
4. HTML sidee ayuu ula shaqeeyaa CSS iyo JavaScript?
- HTML: Qaab-dhismeedka iyo macnaha content-ka.
- CSS: Midab, font, spacing iyo layout.
- JavaScript: Isdhexgal iyo dhaqdhaqaaq ku dhisan logic.
5. Tusaale HTML
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="so">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Boggeyga Koowaad</title>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Ku soo dhowow!</h1>
  </header>
  <main>
    <p>Waxaan baranayaa HTML.</p>
    <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/">Wax badan baro</a>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
6. Qodobo muhiim ah
- <h1> waa cinwaan muhiim ah; <p> waa paragraph.
- <a> wuxuu sameeyaa link; <img> wuxuu muujiyaa sawir.
- <form> wuxuu ururiyaa input; xog dirista iyo kaydinteedu waxay u baahan karaan server.
- Isticmaal alt marka aad sawir ku dartid, iyo label marka aad form samaynayso.
- HTML waxa uu ka shaqeeyaa browser-yada waaweyn, waxaana muhiim ah in la tijaabiyo bogga.
